040:1":{"text":"흠... 하나 일러두자면, 그대가 은월관에서 카드판에 낄 자격을 잃었으니 가지고 있던 블루 칩도 전부 사라졌다오.","source_cn":"容我提醒，你现在已经被禁止在会馆里玩牌了。与此同时，你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x093922A90A30E6D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1720829041:1":{"text":"...잠깐, 그게 무슨 말이에요?","source_cn":"……喂，这也太不讲理了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9285C37E148BBB18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1720829042:1":{"text":"후후... 농담이오. 이 일은 따로 사람을 시켜 처리하도록 하겠소.","source_cn":"呵呵……开个玩笑。知道了，这件事我会命人去办。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91E1C39BF5CB19A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1720829043:1":{"text":"그렇다면, 무운을 빌겠소.","source_cn":"那么，便祝你一路顺风了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC60C2DE1A6301997","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:埃德加":{"text":"에린도르","source":"埃德加","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":44,"localized_text_count":43,"speaker_count":2}}